      "panquire_t_01_price_and_performance": "Panquire T-01 / Price and performance",
      "a_60v_electric_dirt_bike_for_weekend": "A 60V electric dirt bike for weekend trails",
      "shopping_for_an_affordable_electric_dirt_bike": "Shopping for an affordable electric dirt bike? The T-01 pairs a removable 1,872 Wh battery with 19-inch front and 17-inch rear wheels. If you’re weighing a Sur-Ron alternative, the 60V Light Bee X has a larger 2,400 Wh battery. The Qronge X1 Spark L has a 1,728 Wh battery and smaller 17-inch front and 14-inch rear wheels.",
